    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1621-a2">

                <pb facs="1321" n="1205" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1205"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to the American
                        Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2771.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of Foreign Relations</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your excellency’s esteemed communication No. 248 of yesterday’s
                    date, of which I have noted the contents, then referring it to the Minister of
                    Public Works for him to take note of the declaration which your excellency makes
                    relative to the new clause which, according to the information you have, has
                    been introduced into the proposed contract with Messrs. Hyatt and Wilcox,
                    concerning the construction of a railway from Anton to Santiago with a branch
                    from Antón to Penonomé.</p>
                <p>I avail of this opportunity to confirm to your excellency the declaration which I
                    have already made to you, that if this contract is signed it will be wholly in
                    accord with the indications of the Government of the United States.</p>
                <p>I avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eduardo Chiarí.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
